{"c":[{"name":"20261021T235230Z-23d8d4c0fc64a011","text":"From inside uv run --with duckdb==2.0.0, a nested uv run --no-sync --with duckdb==VERSION selects VERSION even when VIRTUAL_ENV is inherited (uv warns that VIRTUAL_ENV is ignored). Unsetting VIRTUAL_ENV is not what makes --with take effect. Measured 2026-10-21.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261021T235230Z-b56004adfb0e92b0","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 EXPLAIN of the unscoped cosine query contains substring HNSW via the line 'HNSW Index: embeddings_vector_hnsw'; the operator title is 'Hnsw Index Scan', which does not itself contain HNSW. Case-sensitive 'HNSW' passes on 1.5.4 and 2.0.0.","type":"note"}]}
